  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0"><name>Info</name><text>This scaffold detail view focuses on the scraper family. Position, location, and bias voltage are now available as provisional scaffold PVs so the operator display can be laid out before the final hardware interface is defined.</text><x>20</x><y>56</y><width>860</width><height>52</height><font><font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="12.0"></font></font><wrap_words>true</wrap_words><vertical_alignment>1</vertical_alignment><actions></actions></widget>
