  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0"><name>Foot</name><text>This display gives the right operator slots for scraper position, location, bias voltage, and current. The current scaffold shows 4 stand-in devices, but the real system is expected to be 16 scrapers in 4 locations (Top, Bottom, Left, Right) once the lattice table is folded in. The waveform PV is present in the IOC as WFM_RBV, but a true live plot will need either a defined X-axis convention or a history/archiver source.</text><x>20</x><y>520</y><width>1240</width><height>42</height><font><font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="12.0"></font></font><wrap_words>true</wrap_words><vertical_alignment>1</vertical_alignment><actions></actions></widget>
</display>
